<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Detonator on Wipeout Pulse: this project's own HUD layout, since Pulse ships no
     Detonator. Arranged as Fury's: the EMP gauge bottom left, the clip over the shield bar
     bottom right, the score where Zone has it, drawn with the disc's own HUD texture, fonts, strings and countdown models
     (docs/gameplay/detonator-pulse.md, "The HUD"). Six EMP pips, one per pad charge up
     to a full EMP; EmpReady marks the third, where the EMP can be fired. -->
